    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66992" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετατροπ-ή</span></b> , ἡ, (<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετατρέπω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.2
				</span></i>
			) <i>retribution</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔτι σε μετατροπὰ τῶνδ᾽ ἔπεισιν ἔργων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Andr.</u>
					492
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>change</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σώματος γένεσις καὶ μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.720b
				</span></i>
			, cf. Vett. Val.<i><span class="en">
				81.3
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Nech.
			</span></i> ap. eund. <i><span class="en">
				125.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Greg.Cor.
				<u>Trop.Prooem.</u>
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τὰ βελτίονα μ. λαμβάνειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hippod.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				4.34.71
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>overthrow</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βασιλέων μετατροπαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Herm.
				</span></i>
			 ap. eund.<i><span class="en">
				1.21.9
			</span></i> (prob.).</div>
